  "description": "WE ARE EDN is an all-day eating experience perfectly located in Amsterdam's heartbeat. It’s a welcoming space for hungry humans who value connection—both with each other and the environment.\n\nOur vibrant team serves up breakfast and lunch classics, fun sharing plates, fresh salads, meat and plant-based burgers, pizzas, pastas, and grilled steaks—made with seasonal ingredients and rooted in the nature of things.\n\nFrom the buzz of daily activations to the comfort of sharing great food in great company, WE ARE EDN is more than a meal—it’s a moment. After all, sharing is caring.",
